    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b>1. CONTROL THE DETECTIVE ARM POINTER</b>\nMove your mouse to control
    the detective's arm across the investigation table. Hover and click on items
    with your index fingertip.\n\n<b>2. EXAMINE TABLE EVIDENCE & CASE NOTEBOOK</b>\nClick
    on the open case book to review suspect dossiers, alibis, and clue notes. Inspect
    the knife, evidence envelope, and drink cup.\n\n<b>3. INTERROGATE & EXPOSE CONTRADICTIONS</b>\nQuestion
    suspects. When a statement contradicts physical evidence, press <b>[\u26A1 CHALLENGE]</b>
    and present the matching proof to trigger a breakthrough confession!\n\n<b>4.
    SYNTHESIZE DEDUCTIONS & CONCLUDE</b>\nConnect clue pairs on the Deduction Board
    and complete the final inquiry to earn your detective rank (S to D)!"
